  "title": "sharkd: Catch exceptions from tvb_ functions in process_frame_cb",
  "description": "sharkd_session_process_frame_cb calls tvb_ functions that can throw\nDissectorBug exceptions, and it should not crash in such a case\n(unless the environment variable WIRESHARK_ABORT_ON_DISSECTOR_BUG=1\nis set, which makes it crash anyway.)\n\nMove some common code into a common static function.\n\nPing #21133\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
